    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide fluor-gases emissions data that can be used in interdisciplinary studies of the environment.",
    "ciesin:supplemental_info": "The emissions data are not completely identical to those in Appendix VII of the SRES report as published by Cambridge University Press (2000). In a small number of cases, slight corrections were made after the publication of the document to prevent negative emissions, which occurred as a result of the standardization procedure.",
